### Test Question Bank APIs

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Create Question Bank
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/question-banks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "بنك أسئلة الصف الأول الثانوي",
  "description": "أسئلة شاملة للصف الأول الثانوي",
  "grade_id": 1,
  "is_active": true,
  "price": 100
}

### 2. Create Question Bank (Minimal Data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/question-banks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "بنك أسئلة تجريبي",
  "grade_id": 1
}

### 3. Get All Question Banks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/question-banks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Get Question Bank by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/question-banks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Update Question Bank
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/question-banks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "اسم محدث",
  "description": "وصف محدث",
  "is_active": false
}

### 6. Delete Question Bank
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/question-banks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Test with Invalid Data (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/question-banks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "وصف بدون اسم",
  "grade_id": "invalid"
}

### 8. Test with Missing Required Fields (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/question-banks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "وصف فقط"
}















